**NEWS**  

We are delighted to announce that the renalMRI.org society has chosen the next location for the **7th International Renal MRI Meeting**. 
It will take place in Uppsala, Sweden on **October 11-12, 2027**. 

Professor Per Liss at the Department of Radiology at Uppsala University will organise the meeting.  

Uppsala is situated close to the international airport outside Stockholm. The time from the airport to Uppsala is 30 minutes by train.

More information will be presented shortly here. 

We welcome all participants to this important meeting in Sweden!
